/*
 Cards
 */
"foolCard_description" = "Today you are waiting for new and exciting things. Today's circumstances can make you joke or discover something new. Get ready to improvise and take the initiative today. You will be allowed to try on the role of a carefree child, for whom a serious life temporarily turns into an exciting game. Do not miss this opportunity, because probably today you will be able to find something really worthwhile for yourself that will make your soul tremble and allow you to gain personal freedom.";
"magicianCard_description" = "Your active position can make today very successful. Today everything is in your hands and your power! You have everything you need to make the right decision, start a new project, speak publicly, or get the right people on your side. Show all your charisma and charm today, use a non-standard approach. Be a leader and everything will turn out great for you.";
"highpriestessCard_description" = "Today you need to listen to your inner voice and act according to the situations that you will find yourself in. On this day, you should rely on your intuition, because logic will probably not be able to give you answers to your questions. Do not look for explanations and excuses for those questions that you do not want to accept. You need to appreciate the time, and every second of this day.";
"empressCard_description" = "The Empress card will bring you an exciting day today that will help you grow and develop. You may want to go to nature to give energy and nourishment to your body and soul, do not give up on this idea - it will bring you an abundant state. You may have a lot of interesting ideas and creative ideas. Try to think about how you can implement them, because they will be really worthwhile and successful for you.";
"emperorCard_description" = "Today you will succeed in everything that you undertake, there will be enough strength, energy and determination for everything. If you have a difficult task or a problem that has been put off for a long time, this is what you need to take on. It is necessary to act decisively, but carefully and thoroughly. Or today you will meet a powerful person, occupying a high position and gain patronage in his person.";
"hierophantCard_description" = "Today you can get sensible, reasonable advice, a hint on how to get out of the situation, so be more sensitive to people than life experience is much wider and more diverse than yours. He can actually help you in the direction of resolving your concerns. Or you yourself can become a teacher for someone, the main thing is not to assert yourself at the expense of another.";
"lovesCard_description" = "Today you need to make a final decision, regardless of whether it is related to professional activities or to some personal matters. If you doubted something for a long time or simply did not rush things, now fate gives you a chance to put an end to it and end a long intrapersonal conflict that slows you down and does not give you concentration and concentration. The card reminds you of the importance of making a decision and establishing a stable mindset.";
"chariotCard_description" = "You should only move forward, overcoming all obstacles in your path. Today you will be able to eliminate the contradictions and conflicts that for a long time could exhaust and disturb you. Only your decisive steps, strong-willed decisions and disciplined actions will contribute to your luck. Remember that Fortune is a capricious lady and loves decisive people.";
"strengthCard_description" = "Today, the card recommends that you apply your talents to work or become more active on a personal level, you will have enough strength for absolutely everything. In difficult matters, show wise perseverance and do not enter into conflicts. After all, it is your strong-willed spirit that allows you to solve problems to which you show your wisdom.";
"hermitCard_description" = "Today you should rely only on yourself. Make decisions slowly and carefully, on your own and without the advice and opinions of others, as well as generally accepted norms. You may feel lonely today, but do not be afraid of this state - by accepting it, it will allow you to rethink and understand a lot, to shift your focus to more important things. It is advisable to move the fuss and the usual things, but if you do not have such an opportunity, you need to do them scrupulously and responsibly, relying solely on your own capabilities.";
"wheelOfFortuneCard_description" = "Today, positive events await you in life in general or in one of its aspects. Whatever happens in your destiny, or today - everything must be accepted with gratitude and appreciated for yourself as an acquisition of new opportunities. You have the opportunity to achieve a lot today: take the first step, take the initiative - in any case, somewhere Fortune will smile at you. Events can somehow happen that will have roots in your past life.";
"justiceCard_description" = "Thanks to this card, today can be decisive for you. You need to take the time to understand your affairs as carefully as possible, to make responsible, objective and thoughtful decisions. Try to objectively evaluate the people around you, as well as your own thoughts and actions, and make decisions based on the positions of your sound and sober mind. Nothing will be given for free, but you will not be hindered in anything today if you are ready to answer for everything you receive.";
"hangedCard_description" = "Today you need to be patient and just get through the day. Your attempts to somehow influence the events around you and accelerate their course will only lead to the opposite result, so the best way out for you is to spend time comprehending the situation and developing action plans for the future. Even if serious business awaits you on this day, try to step back a little and not make drastic and drastic decisions. Take a mostly observer position.";
"deathCard_description" = "Today you may feel the urge to let go and change something in your life. Any of the aspects of your being can become a passed stage and become a thing of the past. This may be good news for you that it has finally happened and everything is over. But something you may not want to part with, because it meant so much to you. In any case, you will understand that the time has come for healing and renewal, but how you perceive it depends on you. You will understand that there is nothing to be done here and you need to come to terms with the circumstances, preparing to part with the past.";
"moderationCard_description" = "You can truly call today a magical day. You may have new discoveries, events in your life, you may feel a creative flight and inspiration, or you may be overwhelmed by a wave of calmness and dimension, which can help calm a problem that has been disturbing you for a long time. Perhaps, with the help of this state, you will be able to not only improve your life, but even help other people, solving their problems with pleasure. In any case, try to use this state productively for yourself.";
"devilCard_description" = "Today you may encounter the shadow side of your character. Accept the challenge in the right way for you, face fear in the face and try to accept it without denying it, while consolidating the final sound decision. Perhaps someone may try to lead you astray and direct you to an unseemly act, or you completely decide to change your principles. Try to limit the impulse to the right positions of your soul or postpone decisions. This may be a temptation for you.";
"towerCard_description" = "Today can bring quite difficult circumstances related to the loss of something very important to you. It can become decisive, important, transformational and will influence the subsequent life. But remember that any loss will turn into favorable opportunities and the achievement of new goals in the future. Try to analyze and track the causal relationship, why the loss occurs, your past decisions could lead to this and this does not give you further development.";
"starCard_description" = "Today you will be able to catch a glimmer of hope in what you could already give up and be disappointed. A star is the awakening of your faith or the fulfillment of a dream, so try to remember what you really wanted, for example, in childhood, maybe today fate will smile at you and give you a piece of happiness. You need to appreciate the opportunities presented to you, to believe in yourself. Higher powers favor you, even if your goal seems unrealistic, the plan is crazy - do not stop, you have set yourself a goal and nothing will stop you.";
"moonCard_description" = "Today may seem unfavorable to you and may carry a warning of danger for you, or hint that someone is deceiving you and leading you by the nose. You may have a bad dream or feel quite nervous and depressive. Try to intuitively feel what they want to warn you about. But you should not attach special importance to your dreams, and scare yourself with ghosts and mysticism.";
"sunCard_description" = "Today you will remember some bright and happy event. It can be either a holiday in honor of the completion of something difficult, or you will defeat something or someone, or a stream of inspiration will open inside you, a truth long hidden from you will open, or just a day will pass without problems and give a feeling of happiness and cheerfulness. You should take on some new activity or implementation of a new idea, they will become successful for you. Do not forget that there are people around you who will also want to take part in this. Do not deny them the opportunity to share happiness with you.";
"doomsdayCard_description" = "Today you can cope with any troubles and get out of impasses. And in many ways, your Guardian Angel will probably contribute to this. Moreover, some problems can be solved without your participation at all. You need to be careful and seize the opportunity in time. If you manage, then fate guarantees you success and nice bonuses. But you need to rely solely on your own strengths and take them as a basis. Miracles from above are created through the hands of people.";
"worldCard_description" = "Today could be a very lucky day for you. Either you can go somewhere on the road today, maybe even on a trip, which will bring you incredible peace and inspiration. You will feel strength and harmony with the world around you and will be able to fully enjoy this day, its calm and favorable outlines. It will seem to you that everything is going as it should. If you are in need of a place where you can find shelter, then the card of the day guides you to take that step and change your place of residence. Or today you can clearly feel the completion of something very important for yourself.";

/*
 Map
 */
"foolCard_map_description" = "This card has infinite potential and speaks of an open opportunity to build your life from scratch. The jester personifies innocence and naivety. Therefore, it often means the beginning of a new journey that builds character, fills with optimism and relieves restrictions. This card is an inspiration for courageous deeds and gives a chance to discover something new, to feel a variety of emotions and feelings. The card does not give confidence in the future, it does not have stability. The jester is a card of energy and joy, resetting the past, a new look at the world and adventure. The jester card warns of something completely new that is ready to burst into life, which can cause chaos in this life, but there is nothing dangerous in this. The card speaks of the beginning of a new life cycle, in principle, of any new business and undertakings, of completely radical steps and decisions. The map fully reflects the situation of a person who rewrites a draft again, by trial and error. He doesn't know if the new story he writes will be the perfect clean cut, but he writes it anyway in the hope that it will be much more interesting and cleaner than the previous one. The jester personifies the crossroads of life's branching roads and the choice of one of them, the choice of a new round of development, using pure and unspent energy, as well as an open heart. The map carries with it an understanding of the difficulty of the road, the presence of troubles and dangers on it, but also carries hopes for ease and wonderful development. This card also brings an unexpected turn of events, a surprise. The jester can also point to unexpected unplanned circumstances that can turn the general usual state of affairs upside down. It can describe a situation where an important decision needs to be made, or the consequences of a decision made in the past. Each person is free to choose any direction, to follow the path to which the soul lies. The card speaks of a good opportunity to gain freedom, which is by no means often given to a person in life, and the Jester is a kind of blessing for choosing a new life with new energies, where a person has a chance to write his story again from a new clean page, differently, differently. The map can also show the very beginning of some new project, which is just being born and the very first steps are being taken towards its implementation. If we consider the card as a characteristic of a human personality, then such a person can be called quite naive and ingenuous, and perhaps even irresponsible somewhere, or easy-going.";
"magicianCard_map_description" = "The Magus card is very energetically saturated and positive, calling for creative action on the part of a person. This card suggests that the person whom it characterizes has the power and ability to manage the course of events and control his environment, you just need to strain your will and mind - and then it will be possible to subjugate the elements in the game, people, resources, the driving forces of the ongoing action . The magician describes a situation that is completely subject to the person about whom this card speaks. It is he who chooses the roles, sets the direction and arranges the scenery, controlling the situation. If this card describes a period and a state, then it speaks of relative security and success, of the opportunity to create favorable conditions and take control of the situation, transform and improve your life. According to this map, changes occur on behalf of the person whom it characterizes. She personifies unshakable power, power, success and self-awareness, which lead to the realization of what was conceived into reality. This card can warn that actions taken in a given period of time have maximum effectiveness and efficiency. The card hints at the ability to bring miracles to life and create it. First of all, it is important to learn how to manage your thoughts and the emotional sphere, because in this period it is consciousness that determines the surrounding being. The magician is a kind of trump card in his hands, allowing you to start and play the game. The card speaks of the presence of many new opportunities for solving old problems, achieving goals and the expected imminent development of events. The card speaks of a rare opportunity to transform the situation, move to a qualitatively different level of being, surpass oneself, master new areas of life, reach new heights in any aspect of one’s life .. It can announce a new period of life, when nothing has yet resolved and no errors made. The energy of the Magician is very purposeful and orderly. What this energy will lead to in the future depends on the person himself. The card gives you the opportunity to assert yourself and transform the world for yourself. A person himself should be well aware of that aspect of his life in which it is time to be active and take the initiative into his own hands, for implementation there are all the necessary resources - a plan, material prerequisites, time, people, skills, personal qualities, ripened karma. Everything is available, everything works for a person and everything is in his hands. It remains to add initiative and enterprise.";
"highpriestessCard_map_description" = "The High Priestess may indicate a hidden secret female face. The secret may lie in the mystical nature and character traits, or in secret influences on her part of a manipulative nature. More often, this card indicates the presence of a secret, the characteristics of which can be described by cards nearby. It is quite difficult to discover this secret for yourself, it will be revealed in due time, when a person is sufficiently ready for it and the circumstances around will be arranged properly. If a person is accustomed to looking at the world point-blank and rather directly ignoring hints and figurative meanings, secrets can forever remain unrevealed. It teaches to trust the wisdom of unconscious forces and the mysterious inner world, intuitive rather than logical. The High Priestess advises to pay attention to coincidences, listen carefully to clues, pointers on the path of life. The card personifies the unconscious part of the human manifestation - intuition, premonition, inexplicable firm confidence in something. This is precisely the key to the mysterious truth that eludes logic and sanity. The knowledge that a person is looking for is within himself and is located in the depths of consciousness. The main meaning of the card is wisdom, knowledge, understanding, the ability to learn, teach, comprehend the sacraments and initiate the sacraments. Speaking about the characteristics of the situation, this card reports that information will slowly come to light that will make you look at everything from a completely different point of view. In the situation under consideration, there is too much influence of hidden factors that must be accepted as it is, finding peace and withdrawing into oneself. The card disposes to the need to spend time in reflection, in search of peace, rather than answers and solutions, they will come at the right time. The high priestess teaches acceptance of the will of external events and humility with them. Development in this direction can lead to tangible enlightenment and personal growth. Acquired new knowledge and wisdom can very likely relate to occult knowledge, but it can also be related to professionalism in principle, when the essence is comprehended in high states of consciousness. In any case, the card carries with it the unknown, the vagueness of prospects and the uncertainty of the future, the secret, the discovery of which has not yet come its time, hidden factors that have yet to be known. Often, the card speaks of hidden magical influences that have affected a person or situation, especially with the corresponding cards nearby.";
"empressCard_map_description" = "The Empress embodies the awakening of nature and the energy of abundance and growth. The card portends a busy time, rich in events. Describing the situation with this map, we can say about its rapid development. The Empress has a colossal life-giving energy and she can give a new start and growth to anything: be it a new project, personal relationships, a course of recovery, building a house, or an idea that was once abandoned. The Empress personifies prosperity and growth, fertility and development, care and guardianship. Its traditional meanings are development, progress, creation, implementation. The Empress also symbolizes beauty and kindness, the manifestation of any form of motherhood - security, physical and emotional comfort, enjoyment of life, a celebration of body and soul, the gift of mutual love. If this card describes the process, then it portends a busy time, rich in satisfying events. Considering the situation on this map, it is favorable, rapidly developing and leads along the path of development. Also, this card speaks of a sense of self-sufficiency, developed self-worth and integrity of the individual. It can also describe the period when stabilization is achieved and the creative creative phase is underway, or the moment when the cycle is close to completion. The Empress is traditionally the significator of a woman - wife, mother. She is good in all her manifestations - this is a wonderful loving wife, and a caring, responsible and good-natured mother, and a delightful passionate lover, and a hardworking scrupulous hostess, and a delightful daughter who respects her parents, and a sincere understanding friend. That is, this is a person, a woman of the highest hypostasis. The card can also indicate patronage from this kind of person who can take care of comfort, security, love and development, which can play a very important role in a situation or in life in general. In general, a very good and quite favorable card, giving a positive forecast when answering almost any question. But it is also necessary to evaluate the cards that are nearby. Because if the overall picture is not good, this card may indicate that an adult married woman or having children had a hand in the situation.";
"emperorCard_map_description" = "The emperor describes the state of stability, reliability, patronage, assistance, promotion of growth and implementation of plans. Regardless of whether this card describes a situation or a person. Considering the qualities of a person on this card, one can single out such abilities as defending what has been achieved, setting boundaries, accepting great responsibility, clear, clear, useful and effective actions, prudence, closeness to reality. The card represents a symbol of strength and constancy, as well as influence, authority, power and glory. Of the character traits, firmness and power are clearly expressed. The impact of this card in the manifestation of material form may seem too harsh. The card can also talk about actions from a position of strength, with the conviction that one is right. The main essence that this card carries is the implementation of ideas and plans, movement, perseverance and determination .. The emperor speaks of real prospects, continuous activity, the will to act, the persistent implementation of a clear concept based on proven methods. Also, this card symbolizes the logic of actions, the achievement of goals, the correctness of the chosen path and its successful completion to its logical conclusion. The emperor can manage all aspects of life, stabilize and put them in order, execute plans clearly and accurately, act confidently and purposefully .. Also, the card can talk about clearly defined rules and social norms that must be observed. If it is not about people and situations, then the emperor can refer to public institutions, large organizations, statutory authority and a serious professional status that allows you to establish laws and restrictions. the card may indicate the personal qualities of the above-described order of the person to whom it fell, or the dependence of the situation on a powerful person representing the authorities, depending on the context, the question posed and the cards of others. Or point to a strong patron who has great influence, older in age and status. And also the card can talk about volitional control and opposition, despotism, suppression, straightforwardness, tyranny and authoritarianism. In rare cases, it can indicate patronage and help from above.";
"hierophantCard_map_description" = "The hierophant is responsible for issues of ethics, conformity, religion, the right spiritual path, mentoring, as well as for the learning process, participation in ceremonies. This card includes the conclusion of an official marriage, admission to official educational institutions or obtaining a diploma and other types of official documents. Speaking about the choice of the path of spiritual development, the card carries the meaning of true religiosity and faith, following a pastor, mentor or other representative of spiritual ideology, searching for meaning and finding it. The Hierophant points to an attempt to explain what is happening in terms of any teaching, the spectrum of which is large and varied, but the essence is the same. It describes the process when a person begins to think, interpret and evaluate his life experience, look for meaning and awareness in it. The card governs the observance of prohibitions and the observance of a certain kind of austerity. In general, everything that has rules and meaning. The Hierophant teaches and educates, and the Devil then checks what a person has learned, offering to circumvent the rules and find vulnerabilities and shadow sides. Hierophant can also point to international quality standards, regulations, guidelines, grading systems, commissions, inspections, juries. The hierophant in the layouts can act as one of the three guardian angels, ensuring a favorable outcome for a good deed and carrying knowledge of how to do the right thing. Trust in general and our trust in ourselves are the basis of faith in life and a brighter future. The Hierophant personifies faith and trust based on the steadfastness of the chosen values. The hierophant is responsible for conscience and inner feeling, the fight against evil and negative attitudes. This card indicates that plans and goals are successfully implemented under the condition of a prudent game by the rules and the ability to adapt to the norms of behavior using the traditional approach to resolving issues of concern. Modern man is usually not characterized by profundity and sensitivity in matters of morality, therefore this card is often interpreted precisely in the direction of official events and paperwork. The map does speak of belonging to official groups built on the basis of norms and rules, whether it be the Catholic Church, university faculty and army unit, hairdressing courses or a religious sect. The card truly represents learning, the pursuit of knowledge, and social cohesion. But often it needs to be interpreted much deeper and more consciously, because. each of us sooner or later faces a moment in life when we have to wake up and become smarter, more responsible and more mature. Sometimes the appearance of a card may indicate the need to seek advice from a more sophisticated person. It can also indicate the desire and need of the person to whom this card fell, in spiritual guidance and the transfer of experience to others.";
"lovesCard_map_description" = "The main meanings of this card are magnetic, ardent, passionate love, but it also speaks of choice, of intrapersonal conflict and disagreement. The very conflict between the heart and mind, when logical and strategic thinking persuades one of the chosen paths, citing arguments and facts, and the soul wants to go a completely different path. The Lovers card indicates that a person is at a crossroads at the moment of his life and is faced with the need to make a choice that is very important for him and has long-term consequences. Most often it is a choice between suppressing the desire or giving in to it. This choice may concern not only a partner, but also a profession, travel, educational institution, home, car or lifestyle in general. Often this choice has a rather acute perception due to the mutual exclusion of the options chosen. This is the case when it is impossible to sit on two chairs. Lovers is a card of sincere deeds performed based on the voice of the soul and may indicate that the choice is made by the heart and made correctly. Passionate love for this card certainly applies too. But the map is far from being as simple and unambiguous as it seems at first glance. Accompanying this card is also a test. The card can talk about human mental anguish: the choice between partners, friends or family, past or future, old or new, stable work or risky business - in general, the most difficult time before starting. After all, when the choice is made, there is no mental anguish, there is only the path itself and everything that accompanies it. If this card answers the question: why did this situation occur, then it may indicate that the situation is a consequence of a choice made in the past. If this card describes a person, then it says that this person makes a sincere choice at the behest of the soul and dares to ignore the rules and arguments of reason, or at a given period of time he faces a decision that will require courage and loyalty to himself, as well as stamina before manipulation and pressure. The final choice in the presence of such a card must be absolutely voluntary, without doubts and compromises, where it is necessary to show all the strength of the spirit, having passed the decisive test and test. Also, of course, the Lovers card speaks of an alliance, of the appearance of a soul mate in life. It can be a relationship filled with mutual joy, attraction, relationships, romance - in general - love, a divine gift. The card can describe a serious heartfelt affection, an omen of a wonderful relationship. It can be perceived as a messenger of a meeting with a loved one, a true life partner. The general meaning of the card is reciprocity. Whether in a negative direction or a positive one, this moment must be looked at by the cards that are nearby. As a result card, it promises success or at least stability.";
"chariotCard_map_description" = "The chariot has a fairly strong and powerful energy. This is a card of categorically and unconditional movement forward, towards the intended goals and plans. she personifies tremendous willpower, a solid inner core, inflexibility and self-confidence. The dogs are barking, the caravan is moving - this is what the map carries with it. There is no infantilism, irresponsibility and weakness in it, it is all saturated with perseverance and movement towards the realization of what was conceived. The card describes the moment of a noticeable leap forward in life. If we describe the characteristics of a human personality with this card, then we can say that he is able to overcome obstacles, has confidence in himself and his own abilities, has masculinity and assertiveness. According to this card, a person can perform large-scale actions, both in professional activities and in personal affairs. Everything he wants is carried out: the enemies are retreating, there are no obstacles to success, even if there are, then this is a drop in the ocean compared to his determination. If quite recently there were still difficulties, then the card indicates the importance of freeing yourself from past problems and that you need to make a breakthrough towards your success. Also, the card can display the process in which a person leaves behind his past and begins a new life stage, in which he will gain full strength and determination, show courage and discover a new world for himself. The card can push you to take on a new unfamiliar business and master it to the fullest, using all your activity and optimism, achieving goals and objectives. The card promises time, during which life will not stand still and events will change by leaps and bounds. The card carries the energy of a huge leap forward, overcoming obstacles, a confident breakthrough, opening a second wind at any distance. It also describes the process of releasing and solving problems. The chariot also indicates the presence of self-discipline, facing reality face to face, ingenuity and self-control. The card also speaks of the trials that a person goes through with honor and dignity. The success achieved on the Chariot card is the result of conscious efforts, and not a combination of circumstances, and is considered a special sign of fate, which speaks of the formation of a person through effort. This card may indicate that some event will soon occur in his life that can raise him to a new level of success. In general, this card does not tolerate weaknesses and self-pity. This is a turning point in the personality, growing up, the formation of one's powerful self, and the person living this process is worthy of admiration. He does not expect: neither support from people, nor gifts from fate - he builds it himself.";
"strengthCard_map_description" = "The Strength card primarily conveys the semantic load of the feminine in the classical sense of the word. She personifies both wisdom, and somewhere even female cunning in the positive sense of the word, which is able to pacify the lion's strength with one smile and touch. This is the ability to move through life, achieving the desired without the manifestation of disputes, conflicts, struggle and ardor, while maintaining the energy resource of the achiever. The card calls to bravely and decisively resist the vicissitudes of fate, implying the passage of endurance tests while maintaining patience and courage. It may indicate that the chosen path is correct, in which there is a test of strength and verification. The card disposes a person to remain unshakable and strong-willed for the sake of himself and his interests, maintaining self-control and a balanced emotional background, accepting the challenge of fate. The card can also describe the stage of reaching emotional maturity. It may indicate getting into a rather dangerous situation, where this situation cannot be resolved by force and proof of the truth and you will have to defeat unforeseen circumstances, using all your life experience and developed emotional intelligence. The card, in principle, speaks of the presence of willpower inside a person, energy and stamina, in general, the presence of a complete arsenal in order to pacify an external or internal enemy. With a certain restraint and measured perseverance, a person will certainly succeed if he acts gently, unobtrusively, but under no circumstances retreats. If you describe the situation using this card, then the card says that it arose precisely with the aim of teaching a person to overcome in spite of everything, as well as gaining wisdom and awareness. The victory over this situation is unlikely to be loud and pompous, but at the same time tangible, persistent and well-deserved. And if this card came out to a person experiencing the vicissitudes of fate, he should not doubt for a second that he will cope with the circumstances easily and confidently, having enough internal resources for this. This is the very strength of the spirit, using which a person will surely cope with any difficulty, if he does not let weakness and disbelief take over him. The card also implies the moment that the time has come for a person to curb his own fears and indecision, and what is happening is the very hardening for gaining emotional maturity and personal integrity. In general, this card is about victory with the help of internal strength, not external.";
"hermitCard_map_description" = "The Hermit card as a whole describes the state of a person who is quite wise by life experience, who has passed his life path through conscious thinking and the ability to hear not only the voice of reason, but also the voice of his soul, which allowed him to balance his worldview wisely enough. The card also describes the state of reassessment of values and withdrawal into one's own thoughts, when a person is alone - but not alone, he is only trying to understand himself, his life and being in general. If a rather difficult period has come in a person’s life, which has brought a lot of fuss, misunderstanding, pain and dissatisfaction, the card indicates the desire to withdraw within oneself and the person’s need for introspection due to lived experience, to gain and understand one’s own inner world and one’s personal truth, the need to follow his own path, moving away from the very fuss that swallowed him up. This is the very moment, the period when it is time to re-evaluate your life, your personal goals, dreams and desires, to evaluate your role and belonging in the life around him. It's time to move away from society, to leave everyday incessant worries and habitual things that prevent you from thinking about your soul. This state of solitude allows a person to finally concentrate on himself, as on the center of the universe, around which other events revolve and his life is formed, and to find his own inner light and wisdom, which will allow him to move on in life meaningfully and consciously. In such a state, it is important to abandon other people's opinions, as well as to do something contrary to oneself, one's inner sense of the true and true, to please others or simply in accordance with universal concepts. The hermit heralds the acquisition of spiritual independence and tremendous inner personal strength, which will allow you to go your own way, even if you have to do it alone. Such a state can frighten a person, because not everyone can cope with loneliness, but if a person can accept this state of affairs for himself and pass this stage with dignity and acceptance, the quality of life awaits him completely different than just life out of habit, at the behest , on a tip. A truly lived hermitage brings a stable and strong future, the fulfillment of the destiny of one's own soul and great comfort, life in harmony with oneself. This stage heals a person and makes it possible to remain faithful to himself, to return himself to the true path, closer to himself and his true nature. And we are not talking about the correctness of his actions, which will fit into the norms of the generally accepted - here we are talking about authenticity and the development of an inner core and the ability to behave, to abandon the need to be controlled and led. This is the way to develop a real and authentic Self without a counterfeit existence.";
"wheelOfFortuneCard_map_description" = "The wheel of fortune is a paramount symbol of change and life renewal. The card speaks of the transition, the flow from one life cycle to another and the continuity of the movement of life being. Of course, the card can indicate luck and success entering a person’s life, that a person is entering a life period where the doors will be open for him, but it should be remembered that both good and bad return to life. Therefore, it is important for every person to be able to build causal relationships, because the wheel of fortune is no longer about a successful period in life, but about the fact that the consequences of yesterday's decisions enter into a person's life. And what he broadcast to the world yesterday depends on what he will have at the output today. This is a card of fateful changes, not subject to the surprises of fate right now. A person influenced them in the past, and now he has the opportunity only to accept the results. We are talking about those events where a person can no longer do anything, and these events most often affect the very foundations of the established course of things. The card may indicate a return to something, a repeating situation and its cyclicality, a return to a new circle of passing the same life lesson, and this is already a matter of the will of fate. A vicious circle a person will go through exactly as long as it takes to master its main essence. The wheel of fortune is a turning point in life, regardless of a person’s desire and consent to change. The card may indicate that an event series awaits ahead, which a person will not be able to manage and foresee its development. The map describes a dynamic that needs to be taken philosophically. You may be completely undeservedly lucky and see an unexpected smile of fate, you should only remember that Fortune loves the brave and brave. Events may seem random - happy or fatal, but they are not. In fact, these are only the consequences of human karma, which a person has earned for himself. The map, when considering a particular situation, can talk about forces influencing it beyond human control. If a person is in unfavorable events - the surrounding cards can suggest what needs to be done in order to turn this wheel in their direction - to rise and success. That is, in general, one should not rely on fate and it is necessary to do everything that is dependent on a person, but one should also remember that not everything is under the will and power of man. The card can certainly talk about changes for the worse, if the cards next to the wheel of fortune confirm this, but basically the inverted position of the card, and not the direct one, speaks of deterioration. Fortune still speaks more often about improvements and successful changes, even if it concerns the moment when a person, passing through difficulties, gains precious experience and skills that will make him stronger and wiser. The card is the beginning of expanding the horizons of the physical and spiritual.";
"justiceCard_map_description" = "The main essence of this card is displayed in its very name, and it is customary to depict Themis, the ancient Greek goddess of justice, as an illustration to it. There are no emotions in this card, no focus on material wealth, no ambition - it has only a sober mind and a sound assessment of everything that happens. She speaks of balanced actions, decisions made through assessment and analysis of surrounding circumstances. This is the same justice - impartial and objective, where there is no place for nepotism and matchmaking, where the fact whether a person is loved or not plays a role, the energy of this card carries only an assessment of actions and deeds - if this is earthly justice, if speech about spiritual justice, then a person’s thoughts, as well as his motivation for a perfect action, fall under evaluation and weighing. Justice can often speak of boomerangs when it comes to spiritual judgment. She says that retribution will be received depending on whether the laws of the universe were observed, whether the boundaries of what was permitted were crossed, and whether there was a right to do certain things. If we talk about the material and physical form of the manifestation of this card, then it speaks of litigation and any area where judgments are made or disputes are resolved. If there is an expectation of a court decision, the card says that this decision will be in favor of the person to whom this card came out. The card calls for finding a balance between contradictions that can cause a state of intrapersonal conflict. Also, the card may indicate the need to deal with paperwork, legal activities, controversial cases, such as divorce, compensation for any losses. The card is a symbol of the balance of the spirit and the ability to find a common language with other people. It also speaks of the need for a thorough assessment of all sides of the case in order to make the right decision, to strike a balance in an unbiased, honest and open manner. This is exactly the map that describes the situation: what you sow, you will reap. Another of the meanings that justice can indicate is just the upcoming judgment. And if a person acts honestly and openly, he will decide in his direction. If a person is described using this card, then the justice card is a sign of his rightness and accurate vision of the situation, he is the owner of a sound mind and is impartial to everything that surrounds him. Also, the elements of his character are such qualities as insight and clarity, a sober perception of the situation, prudence, subtle intuition and a sense of responsibility. In general, this card symbolizes the victory of correct and honest deeds and people living in the norms of morality and law.";
"hangedCard_map_description" = "The card carries the semantic load of inaction, sacrificing oneself and one's personal self to humanity, as well as passing a rather difficult life lesson that a person cannot manage. The Hanged Man is an image of torment and a person who does not control his own being, who humbly bears obligations that are not entirely his own. The card as a whole describes the situation of slavery, bondage, service and rejection of oneself. This is the inability to external activity, and a kind of imprisonment in the actually built framework of duty and obligations, a state in which the will is bound hand and foot, and all the forces of a person are spent for the benefit of other people, rather than for their own. A human being under the influence of this card is under the pressure of external obligations, but at the same time, his own passivity does not bring pleasure, but first of all it is perceived painfully. A person feels not free in his decisions, cannot do what he wants and what he considers truly right for himself personally. Patience, humility, keeping calm, waiting are the main meanings of this card. The card can also indicate the moment when a person understands what he wants, but for some reason he cannot achieve this and gives a situation of a hopeless and dead-end situation. The way out of this situation may well be, but not quite familiar and generally accepted and correct. And if a person changes his traditional vision of the current situation, he will be able to find a solution. Another interpretation of this card is that a person is under someone’s strong enough pressure, under which he can be forced to act in a certain way, and he can simply be used in his own interests. If we evaluate the card in a more positive way, then we can say that he is sacrificing himself for the sake of his higher goals, realizing that he must give up something joyful for him today, which will bring a much better result tomorrow. And he can bear this sacrifice consciously and voluntarily. In any case, the card describes the process of obtaining a very important life experience, without which a person will not be able to autonomously and competently manage his own life. That is, it largely depends on how a person will perceive such a position for himself: on the one hand, one can enter a destructive state leading to self-destruction through disbelief in one’s own strength, through constant self-pity and the expectation of salvation from other people, higher or lower energies, from state, authorities, parents, partner. But there is a completely different form of perception, leading directly to the passage of life lessons and the acquisition of skills. That is, the perception in which a person understands that this process is temporary and will last from exactly until the moment at which a person feels a sufficient amount of knowledge and understanding, strength and internal resources - in a sense, a temporary frozen state due to conscious and healthy restrictions . A good example is children. In educational institutions, their will and choice are somewhat limited due to the disciplinary regime, but having gained knowledge, an understanding of both certain disciplines and life in general, will ultimately lead to the fact that this child will subsequently be able to exercise his will to the fullest. The main positive meaning of this card: the growth of human wisdom, intuition, as well as the development of the gift of clairvoyance.";
"deathCard_map_description" = "Quite a lot of people are afraid of this card, but when properly perceived, it is beautiful and delightful. Namely, because it brings with it the deepest awareness and the most complete changes in life, or within the person himself, which will radically affect his worldview and approach to life in general. That is, the death card is a transformation of the human personality, these are deep changes that are called upon to change a person, which will subsequently enable him to change his being. And most often such a need arises when his life has come to a standstill, when a person has fallen into the swamp of everyday fuss, when his ceiling in any of life aspects has been reached. And transformation is like a saving straw that pulls a person out of a state of hopelessness and dissatisfaction, it is a reboot of the system in order to be able to enter a new round of life. Of course, in some individual cases, the card can show physical death, but basically it shows a situation when something in life has come to a logical conclusion and has outlived itself. After the completion of one stage, the beginning of new business will follow, the birth of new ideas and projects, relationships, and the renewal of society. Death obviously indicates that a person will have to part with something familiar and the perception of a person largely depends on whether he refuses it himself or fate itself will lead him to this. In any case, the card can symbolize liberation: from people, from negative thoughts, from destructive emotions, from obsolete work activities, from habitual inhibitory patterns of perception - from everything that limits human growth and freedom. The former habitual ways of acting and the manner of perceiving and thinking will no longer be useful. Leaving the superfluous unnecessary, a person gains the opportunity to move forward to new opportunities. Death is the end of a cycle and the beginning of a new one: like a day ending at night, like the beginning of a new year that has replaced the previous one. Change affects everyone, not dividing people into rich and poor, young and old, high status or not. The main essence is change, transformation, transformation, forgiveness and release, healing, transition to a new stage. If you describe the situation on this card, then feel free to say about its completion and reaching a new level, or complete completion. If you describe a person with this map, then little can be said about him concrete and clear, he is in a transitional state and what he will be like after this state is only a matter of perceiving life lessons, the final conclusions of his thinking and his personal energy resources (how much information he is able to digest and how well he will do it). In general, this is a time of change, in which there is nothing clear and understandable, it is impossible to say what and how will be tomorrow. In any case, the period will bring a new dawn and healing, a freeing exhalation from everything that has already pressed down to the ground.";
"moderationCard_map_description" = "Temperance is a very balanced card whose name speaks for itself. This is a map of balance, harmony of dimension and balance in the context of everyday life. The map often often describes the state of a long period of time and the format of the flow of the natural process of being. It also characterizes beauty, joy, silence, harmony, light, restoration - that is, the period when a person puts his soul in order. The card is quite calm and beneficial, and speaking of trials and difficulties, it says that these trials will be a little softer than they could be. Over time, the intensity of passions, if any, will calm down and clear up and the situation will not become hopeless. The main thing on the moderation card is to show patience, self-control, be able to adapt and compromise, and also show humility where necessary. If this card describes a person, then he is very calm, balanced, harmonious, coordinated. Such a person can be called holistic and able to manage his emotions, showing his intellectual abilities to the point, as well as competently build relationships with other people. In general, a person is quite satisfied with life and has order both in personal and in business and in any sphere of life. It is important for a person to learn to maintain such a worldview and the stability of his perception. By using your patience, you will be much better at exploring new opportunities and making savings for the future. The card brings the correct completion of difficult life periods, influencing beneficially both the situation itself and the person. The card can also talk about getting out of life's impasse and finding peace. Under the influence of Moderation, wounds can be healed, fatalistic perceptions and edges of sharp corners of life can be erased, long-standing painful issues can be resolved and energy resources can be restored. It predicts stabilization with the wise and correct approach. The main thing is not to force events and allow the energies to align in balance and equilibrium with the world and with oneself. All difficulties over time will surely be defeated and defeated, but only by the power of the wise and freely calmly flowing, like water, capable of knocking out a dam in its path with a powerful current. Moderation can also serve as advice and a reminder that seething energy and impulses to move can quickly exhaust a person and extinguish him, crushing him under the yoke of a heavy load and it would be worth saving a little strength by not scattering it to the right and left. They should be distributed reasonably and correctly. The meaning of the meaning is approximately as follows: you go quieter - you will continue.";
"devilCard_map_description" = "The Devil card primarily indicates the stiffness and the presence of addictions in a person. Addictions can be of completely different kinds: emotional dependence on a certain person, similar in meaning to attachment, or there may be emotional dependence on any particular emotion - anger, resentment, guilt, love, and so on. Dependence can be material: in the physical sense of the word (intimate relationships, disability), or in the financial sense (from parents, from a partner, from a boss). Physical dependence can also manifest itself in the form of the presence of harmful and harmful habits. Addiction can also be abusive when a person's self-esteem and will are manipulated. In general, their diversity is quite multifaceted. The card as a whole carries a bad reputation and a rather bad meaning. The devil at least says that a person is not able to keep the situation under his control, and therefore brings a lot of trouble. Of course, another of the classic meanings of this card is temptation. She says that a person stumbled and went on about his weaknesses and base desires, as a result of bringing him to self-destruction and degradation. The person under this card is subordinate, perhaps to the King of Darkness himself. Even if a person is subordinate to another person, he is deprived of freedom and a full life. Another card may indicate a person's dark past, which torments his mind and soul. The devil is playing with fire, in which the flight of a butterfly may be the last. These are strong hobbies that harm duties, loss of conscience and moral values due to passion, in general, impulses and unhealthy ambitions that corrupt human actions, thoughts and blur the lines, brakes. The appearance of the Devil's card can also serve as a warning that it is urgent to take your feet on the spiritual righteous path, otherwise a point of no return may occur and, as a result, you will have to pay very dearly for fleeting joy. Perhaps the person to whom this card falls out, unnecessarily indulges his weaknesses and goes beyond acceptable limits, may abuse his strength and status. The main purpose of temptation is to force a person to behave freely in the moment, causing self-destruction in the future. Also, the Devil can personify fear and cowardice. In general, the presence of any detail that leads to a huge temptation to ignore the rules, shorten your path to success and desired benefits. In general, an obsession with something and the ability to do anything for it.";
"towerCard_map_description" = "The Tower is perhaps one of the most critical cards in the Tarot. This is the collapse, the destruction of life, the disintegration of that life process that has been built for a very long time for a bright and happy future, but as a result, the foundation that was laid into it cracked. The tower is the most difficult process for human perception in the psycho-emotional sense, not to mention the destruction of the physical nature. The tower can describe the events of a severe crisis, an explosion (both literally and figuratively), betrayal, dismissal, family breakup, a loud scandal with the consequences of non-return, the loss of a loved one is a kick of fate and a lightning strike from heaven. In principle, according to this card, you need to understand that events occur as a consequence of previous life decisions and actions. This can carry a completely logical outcome for a wrong choice in the past, for the fact that a person could succumb to temptations, or was inactive, not allowing the voice of his soul to reach him. That is, if a person has got into such a state of his life, it is worth analyzing the causal relationship very well, why exactly and how everything came to that. as a result, the event series passing through this card leads to getting rid of the false, wrong, illusory. That is, only that human support and stability flies, which was built on false values and understandings, on incorrect behavior and thinking - in general, a sand castle. Unfortunately, it does not immediately become clear to a person, and the very first reaction to this period is a huge pain, disappointment and despair, because a person considered this imaginary stability to be real and the most important thing is to understand this by changing himself and the image of his vision. And these events destroy not only a person’s life, but also in many ways his faith in people, in a certain person, in higher powers, inner aspirations and his dreams, goals, plans and desires, ideas about himself and about the world as a whole. This whole process resembles the removal of a diseased tooth, so that caries does not spread to the rest of the teeth, or the removal of a tumor in order to avoid the death of the person himself. Similarly, the tower destroys only that which destroyed a person. And most often the events of the tower are played out in a rather swift and fast way, so that a person does not always have time to come to his senses. A tower is a sharp end to something under the influence of higher powers and at their suggestion. This is a sharp and cardinal restoration of order, this is a raid on a criminal group, after which a mess remains, but without the criminals themselves, it remains only to restore order. In any case, this is the end of the black stripe and the entry into the bright one, but under the rubble of the past. Destruction on this map is usually not expected, they happen quite abruptly and tumble in like unexpected guests. Although this is a fairly expected surprise due to the fact that quite logical circumstances lead to destruction, but most often the voice of conscience is ignored, as well as the wrongness of human decisions and actions is often smoothed out, but the outcome is quite logical in any case, the main thing is to realize this.In a global sense, it can talk about wars, natural disasters, explosions, terrorist attacks, revolutions, the destruction of the existing order, plane crashes, shipwrecks.";
"starCard_map_description" = "The star in its classical sense symbolizes human sincere and undying faith, as well as hope for a bright, clean future, for the fulfillment of one's dream, for changes in a person's life that will certainly lead him to the better. The essence of this card can be compared with the sunrise, with the onset of a new life dawn. This is the very light at the end of the tunnel that beckons him and makes him not leave his efforts on the way to his own happiness. The card can describe a state in which a person dreams, makes plans for himself and sets goals, inspired by them for further movement forward. And with the proper approach and self-tuning, he will certainly bring them to life. The card can also predict a person the emergence of a new acquaintance, new love, overcoming disagreements and gaining mutual understanding, developing talents. The card can symbolize the onset of a favorable period in a person’s life, that difficulties are left behind and many new and wonderful prospects await him in the future, grasping which he can become happier. The main thing is to believe that everything will come true and the plan will become a reality. The card can actually speak of the fulfillment of a cherished desire, the opening of a new path that will lead a person to a better future. The card speaks of the blessing of a person by higher powers that lead him like their child, taking care of him and preparing better prospects. The map can really testify to a guide, a conductor in the person of inner light, presented from above, about a person’s following to his fateful path and his destiny. And in following this inner light, a person can receive certain signs from above, hints, tips, keys to solving problems, warnings against difficulties, sharp and unexpected awakening insights, dreams that carry important information for him, the numbers of angels. And it is very important for a person to learn to recognize and understand these signs, because he is really led and protected. Another of the main meanings of this card is fame, brightness, standard and popularity. That is, it can mean that a person has a certain kind of discussion and attention from the public, whether he is a media personality who actively appears on television, or he is a cool surgeon who performs operations in an unusual way and is quite successful in attracting attention to himself. Even if we are talking about a mother on maternity leave, then this is most likely the most well-groomed and smiling mother who knows the right pedagogical approaches from cover to cover and taught Shakespeare's poems to her child at the age of 2. Examples, perhaps, may be somewhat over, but the general point is that this is a person under discussion, which many may envy, while others take her as an example. Even if it's just the most beautiful girl in the class or even the most sluggish person, who constantly stumbles and hits in view of her abstraction from the outside world. These people can also cause increased attention and discussion. But basically it's still about daydreaming, hope and faith in a miracle.";
"moonCard_map_description" = "The moon card is quite heavy and oppressive. It does not bring discord, explosions, abrupt changes and unexpected painful events, but it is a card of stiffness, depression, something growing and can carry a moment of danger. This card can describe a state of depression, a constantly present feeling of paralyzing fear, intuitive tension. According to the map, the moon can also pass the presence of deep secrets and hidden moments from the eyes of the person who deals with this card. The card carries everything that concerns the hidden and the unconscious: the dark facets of human nature and the shadow sides. The secret that this card carries in itself can end in danger: the appearance in a person’s life of unpleasant moments of envy, jealousy in his direction, intrigues behind his back, and even strengthening against him. And this is not the time when it is worth showing courage and fighting against circumstances. The card warns a person of danger and invites him to lie low for a while, to behave carefully, tracking his every step. Many events that will be subsequently a person will not be subject to and he may encounter an unpredictable sequence of actions. And the best option would be to listen to your intuition and be able to feel and hear yourself, because logic and common sense will not help to assess the situation in an accurate way. The information he receives will be incomplete and at some point he may refuse to face the truth, as a result of which he may fall into someone's trap and encounter difficulties and obstacles. And it will not immediately become clear the scale of the tragedy and how serious the circumstances that swallowed it will be. The risks of losing sight of something, stumbling and making a mistake are too great. The map carries darkness and human perception can only try to draw what is hidden in it, but the assumptions will most likely be very far from the truth. The moon can talk about a conspiracy, about building intrigues and deceptions in the direction of a person, a well-planned theft and any bad deeds that are being done behind the scenes. The moon is delusions, troubles and troubles, this is a wrong vision of circumstances. Either a person himself leads someone by the nose, or they lead in circles around his truth. The card can also indicate that the events experienced are not in the power of a person, they are controlled by someone else or something. The card can still talk about a person entering a dark period of his life, and this period can become quite debilitating and depressing, carrying a state of hopelessness. It can also be an entry into the dark mysterious energies, plunging into the knowledge of the soul, instincts and fantasies, which can be walking on a knife edge. A person can allow his unconscious to take over, which can bring problems in other aspects of life. This is an attempt to enter into lucid dreams, the study of one's premonition, astral travel. In any case, this is a time of accumulation of spiritual strength and knowledge of oneself and everything around for further awakening to a new life and reaching a new level.";
"sunCard_map_description" = "The card is quite positive and cheerful in any scenario, even if it is surrounded by negative cards. It makes any most difficult circumstances brighter, more positive and gives hope that life will definitely clear up and bright sunlight will illuminate it and it will become clearer where to go next. The card carries the meaning of a state of cheerfulness, happiness, in many ways even childish and childish, the emergence of new pure and bright prospects for the future in life, the discovery of truths and the identification of hidden moments in the past, as well as filling a person with self-esteem and self-confidence. It's all good things that can happen to a person. The card brings with it a feeling of warmth, light, security, a clear, bright look at the situation and the successful completion of all problems and difficulties. This is one of the best, joyful and kind cards, predicting the onset of a bright and sunny life streak. A period of happiness and good luck. The card can also describe both the state of a child - naive and cheerful, and the child himself: it can mark both the birth of a child, and simply indicate his help and support due to his purity and bright worldview. If we are still not talking about a child, then the card can talk about the emergence of new ideas and projects, the arrival of something new and positive in a person’s life. If this card characterizes the human personality, then we can say about him that he is a cheerful person, confident in himself and in his own future, to whom any difficulties are quite easy. He aspires to light, purity and high flight of the soul. He accepts any of his shadow sides with dignity, without denying them and not allowing them to spread, which gives him a great advantage over others and can lead to great success in many areas of activity. In addition, he is doing great things at work. That is, a person, thanks to his inner light, can achieve incredible success in any area of his life: in his career, personal affairs, in personal growth, in building communications - everywhere he can come to love, respect, prosperity, joy, success. In terms of state and time period, the card speaks of the flowering of life, reaching the peak of opportunities. This implies the possibility of a person receiving some significant gift that will inspire and delight him, and receiving gifts from people or fate more than expected. A person can be taken aback by these gifts and believe that he did not deserve them and is not worthy, but they just need to be accepted and enjoyed without doubts and searches for hidden meanings. The card can also hint at a holiday about the accomplishment of something important. In general, this is a card of a bright streak, the implementation of plans, the successful completion of difficulties, the fulfillment of hopes and the enlightenment of life.";
"doomsdayCard_map_description" = "The card of the Last Judgment primarily means the intervention of higher powers in a person’s life and his circumstances. Speaking about the situation, we can say that her higher powers provoked her, or they exercise their sensitive control over her. That is, the card speaks of the time that has come to evaluate your life path and be responsible for the actions and decisions taken in the past. The card, in principle, carries the semantic load of the arrival of cardinal changes in life and to get rid of what fettered, interfered with in the past, did not allow to live a full life. Therefore, it often marks the arrival of changes for the better. The Last Judgment can also describe the return of a person to a way of life from the past. It can also be a period of retribution for sins from the past in this incarnation, or for the sins of past lives or working off tribal karma. In any case, the events that take place on this card lead a person to a complete transformation of personality and to the further emergence of new goals, aspirations and intentions, as well as to the discovery of new talents. If we talk about very difficult and difficult life circumstances, the card may hint at the successful completion of a crisis phase, getting rid of difficulties that can suddenly be solved miraculously, as well as the prospect of abruptly getting rid of oppressive circumstances. This opportunity can be quite rare and there is a risk of missing it, so it is important not to linger here. If we consider the cause of what happened on this card, then it clearly indicates precisely the intervention from above. No matter how difficult and painful this event was, it is precisely designed to save a person’s life from sadness and suffering and to be freed. It is the Guardian Angel that leads a person to the right path for him. And its main goal is for a person to be able to make his decisions and go towards his dreams, revealing the potential of his soul, and not live his life with other people's advice and opinions. And a person, having correctly perceived this situation for himself, will be able to return his health, joy, luck, happiness, and also gain the opportunity to breathe deeply. This card calls to believe and trust the higher powers, to establish contact with them and live in harmony with them, knowing and understanding that everything is done for his own good. Also, the card can also speak, in principle, of finding a person on the right road and made the right choice in something, it remains only to continue the path and move on. It can also talk about the final decision, which is no longer subject to change and appeal. The person as a whole on this card can come to leave the usual being and change direction. This is the period of the Renaissance, when a person again begins to live, breathe, build himself and the circumstances around him. Life has acquired a new dimension, it is important to clearly realize this and discard fears and doubts, accepting the disrupted course of things and the incoming changes.";
"worldCard_map_description" = "The World map is quite generalized and means a person's knowledge of world truths and processes of the universe as a whole. The map of the world identifies for itself the position that the world is discovered for itself, recognized, and not conquered and bent. If this card characterizes the relationship of people, then they are quite calm, harmonious and cheerful. In general, this card can also indicate a distance, and quite a lot, which can indicate travel, moving, trips, business trips. If we talk about a person, then the card can say no that he is far away or there is communication with him via the Internet. The card also speaks of luck and contentment, a sense of joy and harmony, as well as being on vacation, or the rest itself. Another of the meanings of this card is the achieved desire, dream, realized plans and embodied hopes. And Peace is a state experienced under these circumstances - satisfaction, inner triumph, relaxation and happiness. It can also indicate an already completed life cycle. Another interpretation of the card is sociability, sociability and good communication skills and inclinations. That is, the card says that a person can achieve success and his blissful state through communication with other people, gaining connections and developing his talents in principle for society, without being afraid to demonstrate them to the public. Also, pointing to the moment of the public, the map may even indicate that the current environment needs to be reviewed and try to build a new one, which can bring much more benefit and full of positive energies than what could have already become obsolete. All problems can become solvable, good people will be drawn to a person in life, and bad people will somehow disappear by themselves. The consequences may be the restoration of health, the arrival of good luck and new perspectives in the fate of a person, which will not even require much effort. And in the end, a person will be able to achieve everything that he could only dream of before. Another map of the World can talk about his transition into a holistic and structural personality, many of the knowledge that he received before will add up to a single picture and give a clear understanding of the world and his life as a whole. He will reach the perfect form of his being and consciousness. He will find his right path and understand why he is in this world and what he should do in it. And when a person comes exactly to his place, which he should occupy in this world, all other aspects of his life begin to improve in a magical way. His problems are solved, the right people are attracted, new and necessary chances from life go into his hands, his energy balance is restored, the financial area is stabilized and enters the road of abundance. The card also encourages a person to finally declare to the world about himself and his life values. Another of its meanings is international relations. At least if we consider it already in a somewhat broader sense than a person and his everyday life.";
